{"seq":3,"slug":"design","title":"设计学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"设计学-简介\">设计学 简介</h1><p>设计学研究如何通过有目的的创造活动来解决问题和改善人类体验。一张海报如何在三秒内传达关键信息？一件产品怎样让用户无需说明书就能自然使用？一个空间如何引导人的行为和情绪？设计学提供的不是标准答案，而是一套在约束条件下寻找最优解的思维方法。</p>\n<p>这门学科的核心理念是以人为中心。无论是视觉传达、产品设计还是环境设计，最终的评判标准都是人的感受和使用效果。同时，设计从不在真空中进行——材料、技术、成本、文化背景都是设计师必须考虑的现实约束，而优秀的设计恰恰是在这些约束中找到创造性的突破。</p>\n<p>本学习空间将设计学的核心内容组织为四个章节。<strong>第一章 设计基础</strong> 建立视觉思维的基本功，涵盖设计元素与原理、色彩理论和字体排印三个基础领域。<strong>第二章 视觉传达设计</strong> 探讨如何用图形和文字有效地传递信息，包括平面设计、品牌识别和信息设计。<strong>第三章 产品设计</strong> 将关注点从二维延伸到三维，讨论工业设计的方法、用户体验研究和交互设计原则。<strong>第四章 环境设计</strong> 进一步扩展到空间尺度，涵盖室内设计、景观设计和城市设计的基本概念。</p>\n<p>设计能力的提升离不开动手实践和案例研究。建议在学习每个章节时，选择一个小项目去实际练习——设计一张海报、重构一个界面、规划一个小空间——在做的过程中理论才会真正变成你的直觉。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-foundations","title":"设计基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-principles","title":"大学设计学 — 设计原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-theory","title":"大学设计学 — 色彩理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/color-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"typography","title":"大学设计学 — 字体设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/typography"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"visual-design","title":"视觉传达设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/visual-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graphic-design","title":"大学设计学 — 平面设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/visual-design/graphic-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"branding-identity","title":"大学设计学 — 品牌视觉识别","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/visual-design/branding-identity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-design","title":"大学设计学 — 信息设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/visual-design/information-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"product-design","title":"产品设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-design","title":"大学设计学 — 工业设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/industrial-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-experience","title":"大学设计学 — 用户体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/user-experience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-thinking","title":"大学设计学 — 设计思维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/design-thinking"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"environmental-design","title":"环境设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/environmental-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interior-design","title":"室内设计原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/environmental-design/interior-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"landscape-design","title":"景观设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/environmental-design/landscape-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exhibition-design","title":"展览与空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/environmental-design/exhibition-design"}]}]}